11. Let the applicant- Vipin Singh @ Shiv Pratap Singh @ Lalji be released on bail in the aforementioned case on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
Vipin Singh @ Shiv Pratap Singh @ Lalji vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. ... on 8 September, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/172588149/
